 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 President Trump signs a stone at the site of a new helipad on the White House South Lawn today. Photo: Jim Watson/AFP via Getty Images 🚁 President Trump gave journalists an impromptu look at his new helipad on the South Lawn of the White House this morning. He told reporters: "We have to bring the White House up to — like I'm fixing the country, we're fixing the White House too." Watch . 💊 Trump is nominating White House aide Heidi Overton to lead the FDA. He posted on Truth Social today: "We need her leadership at the FDA now to ensure that the U.S. remains the WORLD LEADER for Scientific Discovery and CURES." Go deeper . 📦 Amazon plans to bring rapid Prime Air drone deliveries to nearly 500 U.S. towns and cities by the end of this year. Go deeper . 🛰️ NASA is calling off a mission to save a space observatory falling out of orbit, dooming it to a fiery death in Earth's atmosphere. Go deeper . 
 
