 4. 🍌 1 for the road: Coffee goes bananas 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Illustration: Sarah Grillo/Axios Banana is the flavor of the summer, Axios' Carly Mallenbaum reports. 

 It's the fastest-growing added beverage flavor over the past year at restaurants tracked by Circana, a market research firm. 📈 Google searches for "banana coffee" and "banana matcha" hit all-time highs this year.

 TikTok has plenty of videos for the banana-curious — including Eva Longoria's tutorial for making banana iced coffee at home. Go deeper . 

 
 
